1
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:06,860
回到大自然的感觉真好
It's nice to get back to nature.

2
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:09,590
我真该多多这么做
Why don't I do this more often?

3
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:16,200
这森林真美
What a beautiful forest.

4
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,520
你好呀  小蝴蝶
Hello, little butterfly.

5
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,520
你叫什么...
What's your na...

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,650
你在干嘛
Whatcha doing?

7
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,340
我刚沉浸在虚拟现实的乐趣中
I was enjoying some virtual reality,

8
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,120
而你这张现实的大脸把我拉了出来
until you ruined it with your actual face.

9
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:33,510
这是什么味儿
What am I smelling?

10
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,070
这是汽车香片
Oh, it's car air freshener.

11
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:37,850
我在模拟森林的味道
I was simulating the smell of the forest.

12
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,830
真正的森林可不是这个味儿
That's not what the forest smells like.

13
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,890
我咋知道
Well, how would I know?

14
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,590
你干嘛意淫自己在户外
Why are you pretending to be outdoors?

15
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:46,870
你又不喜欢
You hate it.

16
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:49,460
艾米给我看了一个有说服力的研究
Amy showed me a compelling study

17
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,110
研究证实花点时间待在野外
that demonstrated the cognitive benefit

18
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,960
对认知能力有好处
of spending time in the wilderness.

19
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,410
伙计  只要你想
Buddy, I am ready to drive you

20
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:55,710
我随时都可以开车载你去野外
into the wilderness any time you want

21
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:57,530
然后把你扔那儿
and leave you there.

22
00:00:57,810 --> 00:01:00,580
随便你笑  但部分参与者
Well, make your jokes, but some of the participants

23
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:03,330
远离所有科技  在树林待了四天后
who spent four days in the woods away from all technology

24
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:07,530
记录指出  回来后逻辑思维能力提高了50%
reported a 50% gain in reasoning skills upon their return.

25
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,590
好吧  如果那是真的
Okay, if that's true,

26
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:11,610
为什么没有出现更多的天才松鼠
why aren't there more genius squirrels?

27
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,580
你可能比我更需要这个
You may need this more than I do.

28
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
生

29
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
活

30
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
大

31
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
爆

32
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
炸

33
00:01:35,730 --> 00:01:37,230
第九季  第二十集

34
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:50,380
你的茶泡好了
Here's your tea.

35
00:01:52,390 --> 00:01:56,220
不要悄悄走近一个坐在圆木上的男人
Do not sneak up on a guy when he's sitting on a log.

36
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,780
如果你真的那么想亲近大自然
You know, if you really want to be in nature,

37
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:00,170
我们何不去租一个小木屋
why don't we rent a cabin?

38
00:02:00,170 --> 00:02:02,510
抱歉  你啥时候来的  我都没...
Look, I'm sorry, when did you even get here? I...

39
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,320
有个跟我有业务往来的医生
You know, there's a cabin in Big Bear

40
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:07,500
一直邀我去大熊湖那的一个小木屋
that a doctor I work with keeps offering me.

41
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:08,680
因为那男的想勾搭你吗
Because he's hitting on you?

42
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,650
女的
She.

43
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:11,200
那就好
Oh, good.

44
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:13,550
但我男女通杀
But I could get her.

45
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,820
我们周末可以一起去
We could all go for the weekend.

46
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:17,120
一定会很好玩
It'll be fun.

47
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,900
好吧  借过
Yeah... Excuse me.

48
00:02:23,010 --> 00:02:26,170
查"好玩"这个词  再跟我谈
Here, look up "Fun", get back to me.

49
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:28,870
咱俩可以去好好过个周末啊
You and I could still go and have a nice weekend.

50
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:30,030
好啊
Sure.

51
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,870
去嘛  谢尔顿  我们也去
Come on, Sheldon, let's go with them.

52
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:33,480
我不要
I hardly think so.

53
00:02:33,790 --> 00:02:35,000
你们一定要跟以下生物问好
You be sure and say hello to

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,390
蚊子  蜜蜂  熊  蛇
all the mosquitoes, bees, bears, snakes,

55
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:40,200
负鼠  毒葛
possums, poison oak,

56
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,840
最后  也是最重要的是
oh, and last, but not least,

57
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:44,860
玩吉他的少男少女们
teenagers with guitars.

58
00:02:45,930 --> 00:02:47,700
我问问能不能出借
I'll see if it's available.

59
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,140
如果那个研究是真的
You know, if that study's real,

60
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,250
莱纳德回来后可能就会比你聪明哦
Leonard might come back smarter than you.

61
00:02:52,250 --> 00:02:54,860
-你这是在逼我就范吗  -是的
- Are you trying to manipulate me? - Yes.

62
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:55,970
干得好  很成功  我们去
Well done, it worked, we're going.

63
00:02:55,970 --> 00:02:56,980
好棒
Yay!

64
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,270
别这样  拉杰
Come on, Raj,

65
00:03:01,270 --> 00:03:02,310
让我帮你拿个袋吧
give me a bag.

66
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:04,080
不行  你有孕在身
No, no, you're pregnant.

67
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,350
你的力气要用来
The only thing you carry

68
00:03:05,350 --> 00:03:09,010
"帮"人类孕育美好明天的希望
is our hope for a better tomorrow.

69
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:11,930
你去哪儿了
Hey, where you been?

70
00:03:11,930 --> 00:03:13,480
拉杰载我去看产科医生
Uh, Raj took me to the baby doctor

71
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,130
然后我们顺便去了一趟杂货店
and then we swung by the grocery store.

72
00:03:15,130 --> 00:03:17,260
你有买全麦饼干吗
Did you get graham crackers?

73
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:20,340
我是说  宝宝还好吗
I mean, are... what... is the baby okay?

74
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:23,460
买了  很好
Yes and yes.

75
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:25,900
我不知道你今天办事需要帮忙
I didn't know you needed help running errands today.

76
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:27,550
不用啊  但拉杰主动来帮忙
I didn't, but Raj volunteered.

77
00:03:27,550 --> 00:03:28,260
是吗
Really?

78
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,780
是啊  自从你告诉他我怀孕后
Yeah, ever since you told him I was pregnant,

79
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:31,790
他对我真是呵护备至
he's really been making a fuss over me.

80
00:03:31,790 --> 00:03:34,390
这样也挺好的
Oh. Well, I guess that's kind of sweet.

81
00:03:34,390 --> 00:03:37,850
妮妮  我刚给你转发了一张
Bernie, I just forwarded you a list

82
00:03:37,850 --> 00:03:41,260
洛杉矶前五位哺乳专家的名单
of the top five lactation consultants in Los Angeles.

83
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,290
虽然我有最爱的人选
I know my favorite,

84
00:03:42,290 --> 00:03:45,500
但我还是想听听你的意见
but I'd love to hear what you think.

85
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:49,220
突然开始变味了
And it just got weird.

86
00:03:51,770 --> 00:03:53,310
艾米在楼下了
Hey. Amy's downstairs.

87
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,970
好的  马上走
Okay, one sec.

88
00:03:54,970 --> 00:03:58,120
你头上戴的是什么
Uh, what-what you got goin' on here?

89
00:03:59,210 --> 00:04:01,380
我买了一顶棒球帽
I bought a baseball cap.

90
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:02,670
我看出来了
I can see that.

91
00:04:02,670 --> 00:04:03,960
帽子是哪个球队呀
What team did you get?

92
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,440
《哈利波特》的赫奇帕奇学院
Uh, Hufflepuff, from Harry Potter.

93
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:10,520
去森林戴啥帽子呀
Well, we'll be in the woods.

94
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:13,260
我可以走了
I'm ready to go.

95
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,800
你有什么话想要对他说吗
Anything you'd like to say to him?

96
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,050
谢尔顿  帽子不错
Nice hat, Sheldon.

97
00:04:19,050 --> 00:04:20,940
谢谢
Thanks.

98
00:04:21,590 --> 00:04:23,730
你干嘛就欺负我
Why are you so mean to me?

99
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:38,950
你到底在看什么啊
What the hell are you watching?

100
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:42,290
拉杰在网上找了这些生孩子的视频
Raj found all these childbirth videos online.

101
00:04:42,290 --> 00:04:45,750
这是一个女人在河里生孩子
This one is of a woman giving birth in a river.

102
00:04:46,370 --> 00:04:48,630
好吧  那是我这辈子见过
Okay, that is the least Jewish thing

103
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:51,120
最不犹太风的事情了
I've ever seen in my life.

104
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:56,530
你不觉得拉杰对宝宝的事
You feel like Raj is getting a little carried away

105
00:04:56,530 --> 00:04:57,860
有点过于上心吗
with all the baby stuff?

106
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:58,840
不觉得啊
I don't think so.

107
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,090
他只是想要参与进来而已
He just wants to be part of the experience.

108
00:05:01,090 --> 00:05:03,020
好吧  你说是就是吧
All right, if you say so.

109
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:04,210
盒子里是什么
What's in the box?

110
00:05:04,210 --> 00:05:05,620
是一个超声波麦克风
Oh, it's an ultrasonic microphone

111
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:07,360
用它可以听到宝宝的心跳
so we can hear the baby's heartbeat.

112
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:09,580
挺酷啊
That's cool.

113
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,790
我们能试试吗
Can we try it?

114
00:05:10,790 --> 00:05:12,720
那个其实是拉杰订的
Actually, Raj ordered it.

115
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:15,650
他让我保证会等到他来了再用
He made me promise to wait till he was here.

116
00:05:15,650 --> 00:05:16,880
这样他才能...
So he can be...

117
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,980
参与进来吗
part of the experience?

118
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,230
是啊
Yeah.

119
00:05:20,230 --> 00:05:22,510
真惊讶他居然让我们单独"受孕"
I'm surprised he let us conceive without him.

120
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,920
这是他痛处  别在他面前提
It's a sore spot-- don't bring it up.

121
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:31,700
好有爱  好有乡村气息
It's so cute and rustic up here.

122
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:32,350
对啊
I know.

123
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:34,400
你有看到他们还有录影带出租店吗
Did you see they still have a video rental place?

124
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:37,490
好像弗州的威廉斯堡历史保护区
it's like Colonial Williamsburg.

125
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:41,640
手机信号只剩下一格了
Well...cell service is down to one bar,

126
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,630
如果有人需要找医生
so if anyone needs medical attention

127
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:46,180
或者告诉陌生人  他的政治观点很智障
or to tell a stranger their political views are stupid,

128
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:48,140
赶紧趁现在
now's the time.

129
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:51,010
你有彻底断过网吗
Have you ever been off the grid before?

130
00:05:51,010 --> 00:05:51,970
有过一次
Once.

131
00:05:51,970 --> 00:05:53,710
是在我的手机没电
The battery ran out on my phone.

132
00:05:53,710 --> 00:05:56,620
得等我的iPad开机的那段时间
I had to wait for my iPad to turn on.

133
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:59,980
那次我以为他要把我生吞活剥了
I was afraid he was gonna eat me.

134
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:04,160
拉杰到了
Raj just pulled up.

135
00:06:04,570 --> 00:06:06,520
我得跟他说说这事
I'm gonna say something to him.

136
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,690
别说了  他一番好意
Leave it alone. He means well.

137
00:06:08,690 --> 00:06:11,730
所以你不觉得他需要稍微有点分寸吗
So you don't think he needs to rein it in a little?

138
00:06:11,730 --> 00:06:13,700
不用  没觉得
No, not really.

139
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,240
你不担心他表现得有点像
And you're not concerned he's acting like

140
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:18,170
你肚子里的也是他孩子吗
somehow this is his kid, too?

141
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:19,890
他只是给予我关爱和支持
He's just trying to be supportive.

142
00:06:19,890 --> 00:06:21,480
单纯关爱和支持
Just supportive.

143
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:24,220
完全没越界也不过火吗
Not over-the-top in any way?

144
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:25,150
是的
No.

145
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:27,560
大家安安啊
Hello!

146
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:31,360
此熊是美国零售商Costco出的巨熊
2.6米高  含外送费只要280美元

147
00:06:32,670 --> 00:06:34,870
你早就看见他拿着这个了
You saw him carrying that.

148
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:39,240
宇航员都看见了
Astronauts saw him carrying that.

149
00:06:44,650 --> 00:06:46,530
这地方好棒
This place is great!

150
00:06:46,530 --> 00:06:49,230
那个医生真好  就白白借你用了
So nice of that doctor to just let you use it.

151
00:06:49,230 --> 00:06:51,480
她要带我去看拉拉女团的演唱会
Well, she is taking me to an Indigo Girls concert,

152
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,630
话先别说太早
so hold that thought.

153
00:06:55,630 --> 00:06:56,500
好
Okay.

154
00:06:58,030 --> 00:07:00,900
我们要互相检查有没有虱子了吗
Should we check each other for ticks?

155
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:06,160
谢尔顿  就下车走进屋这段路而已
Sheldon, all we did was walk in from the car.

156
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,500
随你便
Oh. Well, suit yourself.

157
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,470
谁想检查我身上
Who wants to check me?

158
00:07:12,670 --> 00:07:15,600
不过  不怕一万只怕万一嘛
On the other hand, safety first.

159
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:24,660
大雨大雨一直下
Wow, it's really coming down.

160
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:26,090
真是衰透了
This sucks.

161
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:27,690
踏青是没戏了
And there goes our hike.

162
00:07:27,690 --> 00:07:30,980
太"失望"了
Oh, not our hike!

163
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:34,560
现在我们只能保持安全与暖和了
Now we have to stay safe and warm.

164
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,820
我们还是能去啊
You know, we could still go.

165
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:37,230
一点小雨也不会死人
A little rain isn't gonna kill us.

166
00:07:37,230 --> 00:07:39,060
你跟谢尔顿在雨中出去过吗
Have you been outside in the rain with Sheldon?

167
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:41,870
-没  -你会祈求雨能弄死你
- No. - You'll wish it would kill you.

168
00:07:43,410 --> 00:07:44,930
我们现在干嘛
So what do we do now?

169
00:07:44,930 --> 00:07:46,460
这里有些桌游啊
They have some board games.

170
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:48,830
大多数的叠叠乐积木都不见了
Eh, most of the Jenga pieces are missing

171
00:07:48,830 --> 00:07:50,800
而拼字游戏只剩七个字母砖
and the Scrabble only has seven tiles,

172
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:53,150
除非你想叠一个看起来很垃圾的塔
so unless you want to build an unimpressive structure

173
00:07:53,150 --> 00:07:56,130
外加"SHNERPF"字样在一旁  否则拉倒吧
with the word "SHNERPF" next to it, move on.

174
00:07:56,130 --> 00:07:57,790
我们来生火吧
Hey, let's light a fire.

175
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:59,560
感觉好舒服
Ooh, that sounds cozy.

176
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,610
我好像没有生过真的火
I don't think I've lit a real fire before.

177
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:03,610
只是很基础的热力学
Ah, it's basic thermodynamics.

178
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:05,040
我们俩肯定能搞定
I'm sure we can figure that out.

179
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:08,120
我可以把木头按圆锥状叠来促进空气流动
I could stack the logs conically to facilitate airflow.

180
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:11,060
这的确能为燃烧提供最足的氧气
That would maximize oxygen for optimal combustion.

181
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:12,330
对  所以我们只需要...
Right. So all we need is to...

182
00:08:12,330 --> 00:08:13,930
搞定
Got it.

183
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:19,030
生火装置是科学家发明的
A scientist made that.

184
00:08:20,570 --> 00:08:24,220
拉杰  你是我全世界最好的朋友
Look, Raj, you're my best friend in the world

185
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:28,430
我也很感谢你对这孩子这么上心
and I really appreciate your enthusiasm about the baby.

186
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:31,130
别客气  我的荣幸
Please, my pleasure.

187
